Figure 13: Exploration trajectories for every AlienCode system. Curves show cumulative gain M t − M 0 M_{t}-M_{0} . The autonomous curve is the mean of
three trajectories, and its shading is ± \pm population SD across them;
each control curve is a single trajectory.

